{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05654","headline":"寻龙湍 · 孙逖","name":"寻龙湍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙穴寻遗迹，轻舟爱水乡。\n溪流一曲尽，山路九峰长。\n渔父歌金洞，江妃舞翠房。\n遥怜葛仙宅，真气共微茫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05654.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05654","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}